{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buddies in a Ball is a  co-op platformer where 1-4 friends are stuck inside of a metal ball together. Coordinate your movements, roll, jump, and scream your way through diverse levels. You're working against the clock, jeering announcers, and a ravenous audience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208260/extras/11a35a5eb14da93d2ec94f28b4a294e2.poster.avif?t=1768917635\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208260/extras/11a35a5eb14da93d2ec94f28b4a294e2.webm?t=1768917635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208260/extras/11a35a5eb14da93d2ec94f28b4a294e2.mp4?t=1768917635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Gameplay Elements:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Teamwork:</strong>\u00a01-4 players control the ball together, communication and coordination are key.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics:</strong> Realistic rolling physics, speed, and momentum make every level a new challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dystopian world:</strong> The odd announcer, crazy advertisements, and jeering audience will keep you on your toes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Levels:</strong> Navigate ramps, tightropes, jumps, rotating platforms, flying objects, and more surprises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboards:</strong>\u00a0Compete to finish the game in the fastest time. Speed runners welcome!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playable Characters:</strong> Pick the character that aligns with your personality.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208260/extras/b41441e1dc0f6f2c3df14d58f19242a3.poster.avif?t=1768917635\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208260/extras/b41441e1dc0f6f2c3df14d58f19242a3.webm?t=1768917635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208260/extras/b41441e1dc0f6f2c3df14d58f19242a3.mp4?t=1768917635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Modes:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free Roam: Access every level, unlimited respawns, explore the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Normal: Respawn at the beginning of the current level when you fall. Complete each level to unlock the next.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hardcore: One life. If you fall, restart from level one.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208260/extras/c2629532ebab10b81638da7053a42568.poster.avif?t=1768917635\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208260/extras/c2629532ebab10b81638da7053a42568.webm?t=1768917635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208260/extras/c2629532ebab10b81638da7053a42568.mp4?t=1768917635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Game Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3208260/242ead1624aaa73e2d375bf9df1b08751ee06020.jpg"},{"name":"Hardcore","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3208260/0633067507416039a95bcc6ca09ac5291404d113.jpg"},{"name":"Act 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3208260/7351c8a82fc0dfa9cc1328f8f17bf66e09728809.jpg"},{"name":"Act 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3208260/b2e7291ddb385a1f3ea1099bb8e133b71dc226c3.jpg"}],"total":4},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3208260?t=1768917635","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3208260?t=1768917635","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208260/79d8d9b0fb7621ae92e959243672a1f7ad3386e5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768917635","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208260/79d8d9b0fb7621ae92e959243672a1f7ad3386e5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768917635","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buddies in a Ball is a  co-op platformer where 1-4 friends are stuck inside of a metal ball together. Coordinate your movements, roll, jump, and scream your way through diverse levels. You're working against the clock, jeering announcers, and a ravenous audience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208260/extras/11a35a5eb14da93d2ec94f28b4a294e2.poster.avif?t=1768917635\" width=